      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"historical consensus\" is a pretty big claim though. wouldn't you say the increase in business costs and the way they could sometimes stifle competition actually had a massive negative impact on the economy? it feels like you're mostly focusing on the benefits and brushing off the actual economic damage people talk about.",
